Windows stopped while a monitor answered a brightness call (DDC/CI). To turn it on again: island settings > Control center > Brightness of external monitors (DDC/CI).	Windows se detuvo mientras un monitor respondía al brillo (DDC/CI). Para volver a activarlo: configuración de la isla > Centro de control > Brillo de monitores externos (DDC/CI).
